configuration.agentConfig.markdownDescri:
Agent type & tool set configuration. Overrides built-in defaults. Leave empty `{}` to use built-in defaults.

Shape:
```json
"mutsumi.agentConfig": {
  "toolSets": {
    "read": ["read", "glob"],
    "deliver": ["shell", "write"]
  },
  "agentTypes": {
    "chat": {
      "toolSets": [],
      "defaultModel": "kimi-for-coding",
      "defaultRules": ["default/chat.md"],
      "defaultSkills": [],
      "allowedChildTypes": [],
      "isEntry": true
    }
  }
}
```

`toolSets`: each key maps to an array of tool names. Given names fully replace the built-in tool set. New names add new tool sets.

`agentTypes`: for a type that exists in built-in defaults, fields you provide override the built-in fields (fields you omit are kept from defaults). For a new type, provide all required fields.

Note: `version` is not configurable here; it is fixed to 1 internally.
